{
  "bookId": "hero-211203",
  "id": "bond-28510",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28510001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "怎么又来了，是之前的表演没看够？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "还是说，你已经完全被我所吸引了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不用害羞，这只能证明……你很有眼光！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "上次你在书架上完成断桥飞跃的最后，不小心磕到了墙上吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我是来帮你处理伤口的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……那是意外！人生总是会有意外出现。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "再擅长奔跑的骏马也会有失蹄的时候。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我不是机器人，出现一点点小失误很正常。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不过那点小伤，根本无需在意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "而且就结果来看，那是一次成功的飞跃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这些我当然知道，不过该处理的伤口还是得处理才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "泉小姐这么抗拒，难道……是在害怕伤口的处理？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "谁会怕这种无聊的事情啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "算了，拿你没办法，要来你就来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28510015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我要是叫出声一句，阿尔贝尔以后就跟你姓！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
